    "72a09a56-9a0e-44fe-a1bc-6d99f9bc469f/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Let's head over there before we start talking!\"<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>(Meet up with <Character key=CharacterId str=Name /> as arranged...)</color>",
      "cn": "“先别忙着说话，我们去那边看看！”<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>（如约与<Character key=CharacterId str=Name />见面……）</color>",
      "ru": "\"Давай зайдем туда, прежде чем начнем разговаривать!\"<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>(Встретимся с <Character key=CharacterId str=Name /> как договорились...)</color>",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "422f85d6e91d4e1d",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-03T21:32:41.679Z",
