    "872161d7-e55d-45ec-ae17-c1a337a3f8f1/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Well, if that's the case...<NL>I have no choice but to temporarily set aside our grievances.\"<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>(Resolved grudges with <Character key=CharacterId str=Name />...)</color>",
      "cn": "“如此……这般……罢了……罢了……既然如此……<NL>我也只得将你我之间的仇怨暂且放下……”<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>（化解了与<Character key=CharacterId str=Name />的仇怨……）</color>",
      "ru": "\"Что ж, если это так...<NL>У меня нет другого выбора, кроме как временно отложить наши претензии\".<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>(Улаженные обиды с <Character key=CharacterId str=Name />...)</color>",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "7524f3cb8e337f72",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-03T21:32:41.679Z",
      "judgeHash": "b09bf76aab3b90e2"
    },
    "872161d7-e55d-45ec-ae17-c1a337a3f8f1/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Other topics...)",
      "cn": "（其它话题……）\n",
      "ru": "(Другие темы...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "617f43a0b54a9c8b",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-03T21:32:41.679Z",
      "judgeHash": "af54c8bb4938c14d"
    },
    "7abebd05-c294-4412-b25e-86ad11fe07ba/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Your reputation is tarnished. You're not one of us...<NL>Trying to make up all of a sudden seems fishy.\"<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>(<Character key=CharacterId str=Name /> refused to resolve grudges with <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name />, who has a lower reputation...)</color>",
      "cn": "“阁下声名狼藉，非我道中人……<NL>此番忽然要与我和解，恐怕别有用心吧？！”<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>（<Character key=CharacterId str=Name />拒绝与名誉较低的<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name />化解仇怨……）</color>",
      "ru": "\"Твоя репутация запятнана. Ты не один из нас...<NL>Попытка помириться внезапно показалась мне подозрительной\".<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>(<Character key=CharacterId str=Name /> отказался примириться с <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name />, у которого репутация ниже...)</color>",
      "status": "judged",
      "srcHash": "11af66a093aec790",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-23T10:21:35.373Z",
      "judgeHash": "be7e5c2591b46999"
    },
    "7abebd05-c294-4412-b25e-86ad11fe07ba/Option_1": {
