    "3fd8291d-6f22-4b24-88ff-e11e9c5dbc6b/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"I have nothing to say to you...\"<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>(<Character key=CharacterId str=Name /> regarded <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> as an enemy and refuses to speak with <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>...)</color>",
      "cn": "“我与你无话可说……”<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>（<Character key=CharacterId str=Name />视<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>为仇敌，不愿与<Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>说话……）</color>",
      "ru": "\"Мне нечего тебе сказать...\"<NL><NL><color=#lightgrey>(<Character key=CharacterId str=Name /> считает <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/> врагом и отказывается разговаривать с <Character key=RoleTaiwu str=Name/>...)</color>",
